## Data Integration Strategy (India Context)

| Data Source | Type | Integration Strategy for Hackathon |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **SACHET** | Alerts | Parse standard CAP-XML/RSS. Use simulated SACHET payloads for the demo scenario. |
| **Local Authority** | Ground Truth | Direct input via our secure DDMA Web Portal module. (Highest Confidence). |
| **IMD** | Weather | Scrape public IMD web dashboards or use OpenWeatherMap as a proxy. Label as "Meteorological Data". |
| **ISRO / Bhuvan / Sentinel** | Satellite | Pre-download Sentinel-1/2 imagery for the demo area. Serve processed flood-extent GeoJSONs. |
| **OpenStreetMap (OSM)** | Base GIS | Extract roads, buildings, and critical infrastructure (hospitals, schools) via Overpass API into PostGIS. |
| **X / Media** | Secondary Intel | Use Tweepy (if API available) or simulate a stream of Tweets and News RSS feeds for the AI to ingest. |

